OL,3,ANepal 'intensifying' efforts to free
OL,4,Ahundreds believed trapped in hydropower
OL,5,Atunnels
OL,6,
OL,7,FNepal says it is "intensifying" efforts
OL,8,Fto free hundreds of people trapped in a
OL,9,Ftunnel at the country's Trishuli-3A
OL,10,Fhydropower site following Wednesday's
OL,11,Fflash floods
OL,13,FCrews - including experts from China
OL,14,Fand India - have been attempting to
OL,15,Fmake contact but have so far received
OL,16,Fno response from inside the tunnel,
OL,17,Fofficials say
OL,19,FHundreds of the 2,500 people reported
OL,20,Fmissing are believed to be employees of
OL,21,FNepal's hydropower sites
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
